NOTICE
======

Third-party data
----------------

`papers.json` and `distractors.json` in this repository are NOT covered by the
MIT license in `LICENSE`. They are a mirror of a public dataset published by a
third party for education and benchmarking purposes.

  papers.json       https://metacircleai.github.io/ziming-paper-collection/data/papers.json
  distractors.json  https://metacircleai.github.io/ziming-paper-collection/data/distractors.json

They are kept in this repository for one reason: so that the readings in
README.md stay reproducible after the live collection is updated. The canonical
source is the URL above; `MANIFEST.json` records the byte counts and SHA-256 of
the mirrored snapshot, and `node fetch-data.mjs` will tell you whether the live
data still matches it.

All rights in that data remain with its original author. If you are the author
and would prefer this mirror not to exist, open an issue and it will be replaced
by the fetch script alone in a single commit.
